# Orders API: VS Code with the "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client), which supports the request chaining used here
# Start the stack first (Aspire AppHost or `dotnet run --project src/OrderManagement.Api`).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5050

### 1. Development token (mock Entra)
# @name token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dev/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Steve", "roles": ["Orders.Write"] }

###
@accessToken = {{token.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2. A Namibian customer (CMA: may order in NAD or ZAR)
# @name customer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Etosha Traders", "email": "orders@etosha-traders.example.na", "countryCode": "NA" }

###
@customerId = {{customer.response.body.id}}

### 3. Create an order. The server computes totalAmount (3 × 19.99 + 2 × 85.50 = 230.97)
# @name order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "currencyCode": "ZAR",
  "lineItems": [
    { "productSku": "PEN-001", "quantity": 3, "unitPrice": 19.99 },
    { "productSku": "MUG-002", "quantity": 2, "unitPrice": 85.50 }
  ]
}

###
@orderId = {{order.response.body.id}}
@etag = {{order.response.headers.ETag}}

### 4. Get it (note the ETag response header)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 5. Conditional GET: 304 Not Modified while unchanged
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
If-None-Match: {{etag}}

### 6. Pay it, idempotently. Send this twice: the second response is replayed (Idempotent-Replayed: true)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 6f1c2b8e-pay-{{orderId}}

{ "status": "Paid" }

### 7. Same key, different change: 422
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 6f1c2b8e-pay-{{orderId}}

{ "status": "Cancelled" }

### 8. Stale If-Match (the creation ETag): 412
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
If-Match: {{etag}}

{ "status": "Cancelled" }

### 9. List: this customer's Paid orders, highest total first (the brief's unversioned route works too)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?customerId={{customerId}}&status=Paid&sort=-total&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 10. Currency not allowed for the customer's country: 400 on currencyCode
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "{{customerId}}", "currencyCode": "BWP", "lineItems": [ { "productSku": "PEN-001", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 10 } ] }
